eReference</n1:label><n1:range xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-X06"></n1:range><n2:relationStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">ordinary</n2:relationStereotype><n2:sourceEndCardinality xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">0..*</n2:sourceEndCardinality><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RK3-001</n2:sourceId><n2:targetEndCardinality xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">0..*</n2:targetEndCardinality></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RK3-003"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"></n0:type><n1:domain xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-X06"></n1:domain><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">sourceReferenceContext</n1:label><n1:range xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C002"></n1:range><n2:relationStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">ordinary</n2:relationStereotype><n2:sourceEndCardinality xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">0..*</n2:sourceEndCardinality><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RK3-003</n2:sourceId><n2:targetEndCardinality xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">0..1</n2:targetEndCardinality></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RK3-004"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#ObjectProperty"></n0:type><n1:domain xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#EXT-OBJECT"></n1:domain><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">bearsVulnerability</n1:label><n1:range xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C011"></n1:range><n2:relationStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">characterization</n2:relationStereotype><n2:sourceEndCardinality xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">1</n2:sourceEndCardinality><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RK3-004</n2:sourceId><n2:targetEndCardinality xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">0..*</n2:targetEndCardinality></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C001"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A managed, reusable information specification of risk-relevant conditions and possible effects. Its identity is distinct from a particular risk case, a scenario execution and the uncertain effects themselves.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">RiskPatternSpecification</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C001</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C002"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A versioned information specification of analysis boundaries, circumstances, time horizon and objective references under which risk statements and results are interpreted.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">RiskContextSpecification</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C002</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C003"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A managed information specification of a possible development of conditions, events and effects concerning one or more RiskCases. Several scenarios may concern one case; a scenario is not the case or an actual occurrence.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">RiskScenarioSpecification</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2baefa84453950b36953da33754c266f0be26382a384f8b00571589f5ce1f397f"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C003</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C004"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">An actual occurrence or change relevant to a risk scenario; a scenario or report alone does not establish that it happened.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">RiskOccurrence</n1:label><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">event</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C004</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C005"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A source-qualified information assertion that possible or reported effects are favorable, unfavorable or mixed relative to identified objectives and context.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">RiskNatureAssertion</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb24ef676514c3db10482c266296db753cb62063889f7e324e645b6845edf2f9024"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb29a1c43791243d0e3e8fb8ce56a10587f26db5d6d2087fcf82fd522593bb70892"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2e30c17e83f45fa058d326f009a030dd55cce2b1fe1bf42f579f3a0b55116d6d0"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2fff3a33377b74228bf77103ed1fa36ea69d59b3bcdf2f2e7ed1a3f7078f5adf7"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C005</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C006"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A controlled value used to qualify the nature of effects relative to objectives; it does not classify risk independently of context. This is a managed vocabulary resource with scheme-qualified identity, not a bare string.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">NatureTerm</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C019"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C006</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C008"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A risk-relevant situation that increases susceptibility to specified occurrences or effects. Reference to it requires explicit source support and does not establish a causal mechanism.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">PredisposingCondition</n1:label><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">situation</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C008</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C009"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">An actual occurrence interpreted as initiating a risk-relevant development in a specified context. A hypothetical trigger description is represented as scenario content, not as an actual Trigger individual.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">Trigger</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C004"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">event</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C009</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C011"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">An intrinsic susceptibility of a bearer to specified risk-relevant conditions or effects. The proposed mode interpretation requires a supported bearer; security-specific exploitation meanings remain source-qualified.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">Vulnerability</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb359697aa4daf0d3323b22877be62f37574cf80b531a2d742e12772edbe3cc1991"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">mode</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C011</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C012"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A time-qualified situation relating an affected bearer to a risk source or relevant condition. An exposure score or its description is information about that situation.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">Exposure</n1:label><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">situation</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C012</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C013"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A temporally qualified state of a risk-relevant situation, distinct from the workflow status of its record.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">RiskState</n1:label><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">situation</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C013</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A managed documentary object with an instituted identity that persists across its descriptions and issued versions. Artifact identity is distinct from a file path, a storage row and semantic content.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">InformationArtifact</n1:label><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">kind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C014</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C015"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">An identifiable issued documentary version of a managed information artifact. Its issued semantic content and effective dependency versions are immutable; revisions receive distinct version identities.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">ArtifactVersion</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2c7c5d64cd9e1e5f703b0c2058a9ca629eb68aa5bd781cbc9f4005ec1183fc71f"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb36e43429ea8d184f45805b9641705cb9b73ad2acbf5450e9dfe4240f197389c06"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">kind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C015</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C016"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">The abstract informational meaning expressed by artifacts or versions. Content identity requires an explicit equivalence policy and is not inferred from equal strings or file hashes.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">InformationContent</n1:label><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">abstract</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C016</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C017"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A managed terminological information artifact that identifies a vocabulary meaning independently of its labels. It is a vocabulary resource, not automatically a domain universal or the real-world entity denoted.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">VocabularyConcept</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C017</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C018"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A governed organization of classification concepts with an identified scope and version policy.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">ClassificationScheme</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C018</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C019"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A managed vocabulary item expressing a controlled classification value within an identified scheme. Scheme membership and version context constrain its interpretation. This is a managed vocabulary resource with scheme-qualified identity, not a bare string.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">ClassificationTerm</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C017"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2f218ff442f271477718b9c573436a6964863aa35274ed11c806fc24e0e09c503"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C019</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C020"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A source-qualified assignment of a classification term to a subject in a specified context.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">ClassificationAssertion</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb1fd40de2743ee8fca10844a301fee5ca87df498aecb97f42a123bdc28844f0654"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2093dbb4fe07648b0c3f4a4eb49f30286ff5fbb6adbe4f80682c9b06b588d1891"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2a703d84e2dec917cc5851c9b1defefc948ad4da9706b231bbf0b7ce4c38e9f71"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C020</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C021"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A managed annotation artifact carrying a lightweight label. Identical lexical labels do not by themselves identify one tag assignment or imply a formal taxonomy.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">Tag</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C021</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C022"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A managed register record about exactly one RiskCase in this profile. Distinct entries, source systems or registers can record the same case. A software record is an implementation record, not an additional risk subject.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">RiskRegisterEntry</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2b0da76911b839a08ffb07ff8086dc4bac9616f2cbbaa41682a5da3e90b6fb4b5"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb359e21c9bc9598c928c5d8a637107ceb7fb0b7c871a317c42535f08e3e0e8b367"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C022</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C023"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">An identifiable version of a register entry, preserving the content and qualified links effective at its issue.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">EntryRevision</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C015"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2730377780b6bd8c84bd6c862bdc92e441bbcc76b8e2a7aa6c9f8861a53d3fce7"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb27d42677a8cd03025e236a2440715eb18bc05b771eb718210b3582a0657940556"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C023</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C024"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A descriptive information item about a risk case, pattern or scenario with an explicit description role and source.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">RiskDescription</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb24ee25c892c0f704a29ef471bbcf04782f321f1155e0e8a4169defdcb5b6a278a"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb25d53240fe8db99f561bf72b8d07e6835d08fe02543af402c8bdaca3a0c3770c4"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb303867d6484fce9f3527ec1fe7ad630a79b87b33a4a3df2bdc3c4a29d646e3ff7"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C024</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C025"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">An information item expressing a possible or reported consequence; it is not the consequence itself.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">ConsequenceStatement</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb28a0a17e3737706faad1484326301c4425daf3a0da8ef827d3da0b789bbbfc198"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2ac22e31c2005ec909d1b900d42a558ec0fdab493d9d8e14424ceff61282ffffe"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2b0d5ea3e7e1c2b639a60ee00366f6363eeb40cc202ecb3e9f67372285f24ee4a"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C025</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C026"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">Recorded information about identifying a risk, including the stated source, channel, agent and available time information.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">IdentificationInformation</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb27be438aa252cb25a86c456b0bc57c594571840635fb516ada90d29b6f379a5c8"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb31672943e3077451755ae8dacd787ea9a78203148b405265b8681ac7aa292fea6"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C026</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C027"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A controlled value naming how risk information entered the registration process; it is not a risk source. This is a managed vocabulary resource with scheme-qualified identity, not a bare string.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">IntakeChannelTerm</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C019"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C027</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C028"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A controlled value specifying the function of a description, such as title, summary or scenario description. This is a managed vocabulary resource with scheme-qualified identity, not a bare string.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">DescriptionRoleTerm</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C019"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C028</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C029"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A controlled value preserving the source-defined position or role of a consequence statement. This is a managed vocabulary resource with scheme-qualified identity, not a bare string.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">ConsequenceSlotTerm</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C019"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C029</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C030"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A managed informational register that organizes risk-entry records for a stated organizational scope and purpose. Its documentary identity does not make it an OntoUML collective or physical aggregate.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">RiskRegister</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C030</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C031"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">An actual activity contributing to risk identification, analysis or evaluation. It may cover only part of a risk assessment; the complete standardized assessment process is outside the current process-modeling scope.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">AssessmentActivity</n1:label><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">event</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C031</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C032"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A managed information artifact documenting an assessment and its scope, basis, methods, time context, participants and results. It is distinct from performing that assessment.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">AssessmentInformation</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb14f262d3efa7c93c4069b473d816425fae1b2f506c357f8497ba89e02babcf4ea"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb1d5c520e6329e19a47357030acfc203772b850129358857944621f50f37d27675"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb25683f0bc57e5df4e02587f01953d567cf2ba83dc243a9bbf378b3a4f7215c909"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb26a12aa10539605f303f56c1e943792f65678cb254cb1ba569ba7d93211a12ef0"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2947a332ccde87c4793410cc95430b1420f2c2879c3e7dd1d51f51aaa16d41596"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb29fbddad183b01cca05bd9aa3c04425b8a9d12bd04f0511224537e2065fb9d64f"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2c091d0db1e7766f8e6b2618d6789c96cbae2e7afd129c82877fbf57365c605fa"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2c61f0f0e9e257442d88ecd920b4f028482409667ccae109e30319ce16e3bb4d1"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb319bb85116aa401cc4e41d12cd77761f72487b9dd97a8cacdb4a3b74664511722"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb332f05a9d3c7833f71bd8c1091b235b9b71a8c60c369eb23cd4018c3f74f53688"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C032</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C033"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A specification of assumptions and control conditions under which an assessment result is interpreted.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">AssessmentBasis</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C033</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C034"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A result for one assessment dimension, qualified by its method, scale, basis and relevant temporal context.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">DimensionAssessmentResult</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb1efc4642d404dfc7145c71c329ee0586986b25986276a120da6fa53479c2e9bbb"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb263cfca8f563e0bdaf91b6ac184825ace2f4927d50cc19756aadace3a29d09452"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2c9d73211e787b141c49ee23bc8f1dd68849455acea0ad56d05dc4e045a2a27b5"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2f009b1d37ce99c5aa2c856aea18e7e3f820491b5a5a8245af1b02f3d7dde1b14"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb343a082c67833bfb72cfd75a9345d0f623a08be7267f7f45511991345fde1a0a1"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb348f967ee4dda8060d3d1a976bd82b6852514898e9ddc905221f9d89ac5cd8e7f"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C034</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C035"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A versioned specification of procedures and rules used to produce and interpret assessment results.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">AssessmentMethodSpecification</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C035</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C036"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A governed scale specification defining permissible values or ordered levels for a specified assessment dimension.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">AssessmentScale</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2a8de0c9b5fcd9e1fa85f70406154fc9697e2dd63db50f80cf464756ceca0f4bd"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C036</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C037"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A numeric assessment output produced under a declared scoring method; it is not the risk itself or a universal definition of risk level.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">RiskScoreResult</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2c334903b93d95da16673b899e09c8ca8bf95c38d46e827f90b71d5ee3a9cd44e"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2d6af9725bbd3edd087e7cc976fdd7c4b6ae9f2b6d974ac87be43fe3bd2427b5a"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C037</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C038"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A managed vocabulary resource specifying a permissible value or category on an identified assessment scale version. It denotes a level; it is not a measured value occurrence or a bare lexical label.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">AssessmentScaleLevel</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C017"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2f2e53353cb51f6d03f39781ac5a02ab8be9e92e81287329dc6405b42f7ddff6e"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C038</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C039"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A managed vocabulary resource specifying an assessment aspect, such as likelihood or consequence severity. The vocabulary item, the aspect denoted and its measured or judged value remain distinct.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">AssessmentDimension</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C017"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C039</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C040"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A controlled value indicating the evidential or epistemic character of a result, such as observed, estimated or projected. This is a managed vocabulary resource with scheme-qualified identity, not a bare string.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">EpistemicStatusTerm</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C019"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C040</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C041"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A recorded decision about treating risk, including the selected option, rationale, responsible authority and relevant basis.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">TreatmentDecisionInformation</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2a8e90b0832d9d7f9b02edea2477ea7bd7b7ec716df0db8dc793e15dbcddbd878"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2c0663e8a11195e2f13dbb31b415790eb6f429f2293eadaaa232d885dc8b72066"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb35e072b2f8de1de9dfaec83a940d0b6eb56730f9aee619c0e8f4e184314f93d64"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C041</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C042"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A controlled value identifying a treatment approach; its selection is represented by a treatment decision. This is a managed vocabulary resource with scheme-qualified identity, not a bare string.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">TreatmentStrategyTerm</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C019"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C042</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C043"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A versioned specification of intended actions, resources, responsibilities, timing and conditions for a stated purpose.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">PlanSpecification</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2c55bff8e468ccc7eb2813bf8b803cd76f4180149d352a600bc706b632c64bdc4"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb36dfad1729ccdc071fc3b0ebc393f7aa5c043cf0745d957ce2506dbb17eb9f78d"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb3a9c85588f11bf6c17b29e506954807ce372a278a4dc169c3a77d34dde71d0d67"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C043</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C044"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">An actual performance of actions intended to modify or otherwise respond to risk, distinct from the plan describing them.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">TreatmentActivity</n1:label><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">event</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C044</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C046"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A controlled value describing the role of a plan, such as primary response or contingency. This is a managed vocabulary resource with scheme-qualified identity, not a bare string.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">PlanRoleTerm</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C019"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C046</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C047"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">An entity capable of performing or being accountable for relevant actions, including persons and organizations within the declared profile.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">Agent</n1:label><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">true</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">category</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C047</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C048"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A human individual who may participate in risk management activities or assignments.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">Person</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C047"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">kind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C048</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C049"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">An organized social entity capable of carrying responsibilities and authorizations in the model's scope.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">Organization</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C047"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">kind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C049</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C050"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A source-level identifier or description referring to an actor whose identity may be unresolved.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">ActorReference</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:resource="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C014"></n1:subClassOf><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:nodeID="cb2760e71f40353963c5914ab3b6615bbc972add9c35988154a8897eba8b3013d6e"></n1:subClassOf><n2:isAbstractInSource xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#" n0:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#boolean">false</n2:isAbstractInSource><n2:ontoumlStereotype xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">subkind</n2:ontoumlStereotype><n2:sourceId xmlns:n2="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#">RKM-C050</n2:sourceId></n0:Description><n0:Description n0:about="https://github.com/ArazSaieArasi3/riskium/ontologies/riskium/0.3.1#RKM-C051"><n0:type n0:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"></n0:type><n1:comment xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">A recorded statement about an assignment of responsibility or authority, distinct from the relationship it asserts.</n1:comment><n1:label xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#">ResponsibilityAssignmentInformation</n1:label><n1:subClassOf xmlns:n1="http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#" n0:res